Theoros Brand Terms

Copyright (c) 2026 Theoros. All rights reserved.

The Theoros name, wordmark, mark (the orbit symbol), colour palette as applied
to our identity, and the assets in this repository are the property of
Theoros. They are not covered by any open source or source-available license.

You may use the unmodified assets in this repository to refer to Theoros, for
example in news coverage, partner pages, conference programmes, academic
citations or investor materials, provided that:

1. you follow the clear space, minimum size and colour rules in README.md;
2. you do not alter, animate, recolour, stretch or combine the logo with other
   marks;
3. you do not suggest that Theoros sponsors, endorses or partners with you
   unless that is true and agreed in writing; and
4. you do not use the name or marks in a product name, domain name, social
   handle or company name.

Any other use needs written permission. Contact brand@theoros.space.

Fonts: Asimovian and Geist are licensed by their authors under their own
licenses and are not redistributed here.
